  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfTypesOfProductsAndServicesFromWhichEachReportableSegmentDerivesItsRevenues contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SegmentsAxis_entity00401731_LgInnotekAndItsSubsidiariesOfReportableSegmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfOperatingSegmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">카메라모듈, 기판소재, 모터/센서 등</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfTypesOfProductsAndServicesFromWhichEachReportableSegmentDerivesItsRevenues>
