  <ifrs-full:ImpairmentLoss contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_IndividualAssetsOrCashgeneratingUnitsWithSignificantAmountOfGoodwillOrIntangibleAssetsWithIndefiniteUsefulLivesAxis_ifrs-full_IndividualAssetsOrCashgeneratingUnitsWithSignificantAmountOfGoodwillOrIntangibleAssetsWithIndefiniteUsefulLivesMember_ifrs-full_SegmentsAxis_entity00401731_EcoSolutionOfReportableSegmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfInformationForIndividualAssetOrCashgeneratingUnitWithSignificantAmountOfGoodwillOrIntangibleAssetsWithIndefiniteUsefulLivesTableOfMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfAssetsAxis_ifrs-full_GoodwillMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="0">0</ifrs-full:ImpairmentLoss>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfManagementsApproachToDeterminingValuesAssignedToKeyAssumptions contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_IndividualAssetsOrCashgeneratingUnitsWithSignificantAmountOfGoodwillOrIntangibleAssetsWithIndefiniteUsefulLivesAxis_ifrs-full_IndividualAssetsOrCashgeneratingUnitsWithSignificantAmountOfGoodwillOrIntangibleAssetsWithIndefiniteUsefulLivesMember_ifrs-full_SegmentsAxis_entity00401731_EcoSolutionOfReportableSegmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfInformationForIndividualAssetOrCashgeneratingUnitWithSignificantAmountOfGoodwillOrIntangibleAssetsWithIndefiniteUsefulLivesTableOfMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfAssetsAxis_ifrs-full_GoodwillMember" xml:lang="ko">경영진은 과거 실적과 시장 성장에 대한 예측에 근거하여 세전현금흐름 추정액을 결정하였습니다. 사용가치 계산에 적용된 할인율은 ES사업부문의 공조 사업에서 식별된 현금창출단위의 특수한 위험을 반영한 할인율 5.66% 및 명목영구성장률 2%입니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfManagementsApproachToDeterminingValuesAssignedToKeyAssumptions>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfKeyAssumptionsOnWhichManagementHasBasedCashFlowProjections contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_IndividualAssetsOrCashgeneratingUnitsWithSignificantAmountOfGoodwillOrIntangibleAssetsWithIndefiniteUsefulLivesAxis_ifrs-full_IndividualAssetsOrCashgeneratingUnitsWithSignificantAmountOfGoodwillOrIntangibleAssetsWithIndefiniteUsefulLivesMember_ifrs-full_SegmentsAxis_entity00401731_EcoSolutionOfReportableSegmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfInformationForIndividualAssetOrCashgeneratingUnitWithSignificantAmountOfGoodwillOrIntangibleAssetsWithIndefiniteUsefulLivesTableOfMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfAssetsAxis_ifrs-full_GoodwillMember" xml:lang="ko">경영진은 이러한 사업계획 승인시 산업 및 사업의 특수성을 고려하여 추정방법, 가정 및 추정기간을 검토하였습니다. 사업계획을 초과한 현금흐름은 식별된 현금창출단위가 속해 있는 산업의 장기 평균 성장률을 초과하지 않는 범위 내에서 추정하였습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfKeyAssumptionsOnWhichManagementHasBasedCashFlowProjections>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfBasisOnWhichUnitsRecoverableAmountHasBeenDetermined contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_IndividualAssetsOrCashgeneratingUnitsWithSignificantAmountOfGoodwillOrIntangibleAssetsWithIndefiniteUsefulLivesAxis_ifrs-full_IndividualAssetsOrCashgeneratingUnitsWithSignificantAmountOfGoodwillOrIntangibleAssetsWithIndefiniteUsefulLivesMember_ifrs-full_SegmentsAxis_entity00401731_EcoSolutionOfReportableSegmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfInformationForIndividualAssetOrCashgeneratingUnitWithSignificantAmountOfGoodwillOrIntangibleAssetsWithIndefiniteUsefulLivesTableOfMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfAssetsAxis_ifrs-full_GoodwillMember" xml:lang="ko">현금창출단위의 회수가능액은 사용가치 또는 처분부대원가를 차감한 공정가치에 기초하여 결정되었으며, 사용가치는 경영진에 의해 승인된 사업계획에 기초한 세전현금흐름추정을 사용하여 계산되었습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfBasisOnWhichUnitsRecoverableAmountHasBeenDetermined>
