  <entity00401731:DescriptionOfStockPurchaseContractsOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_DerivativesTypeAxis_ifrs-full_OptionContractMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_entity00401731_CybellumTechnologiesLtdOfEntitysTotalForSubsidiariesMemberOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">회사는 Cybellum Technologies Ltd.의 주주 및 Stock Option이 부여된 직원에게 Put Option을 부여함에 따라 파생상품부채 45,868백만원을 인식하였고, 당기 중 동 계약에 대한 파생상품평가손실 18,020백만원을 인식하였습니다.</entity00401731:DescriptionOfStockPurchaseContractsOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsTableOfItems>
  <entity00401731:DescriptionOfStockPurchaseContractsOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_DerivativesTypeAxis_ifrs-full_OptionContractMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_entity00401731_BearRoboticsIncOfEntitysTotalForSubsidiariesMemberOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">회사는 Bear Robotics, Inc. 의 Series C-1주식을 취득할 수 있는 Call Option을취득함에 따라 전기말에 파생상품자산 4,359백만원을 인식하였고, 당기 중 해당 계약과 관련된 파생상품평가손실 4,359백만원을 인식하였습니다. 해당 파생상품은 당기 중 지배력 확보를 위해 전량 행사되었습니다.</entity00401731:DescriptionOfStockPurchaseContractsOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsTableOfItems>
