  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfArrangementForContingentConsiderationArrangementsAndIndemnificationAssets contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BusinessCombinationsAxis_entity00401731_AthomHoldingBVAndItsSubsidiariesOfBusinessCombinationsMemberOfDisclosureOfBusinessCombinationsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 Athom Holding B.V.의 잔여지분 조건부 매입약정에 따라 사업결합시점에 동 의무를 금융부채로 인식하였습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfArrangementForContingentConsiderationArrangementsAndIndemnificationAssets>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfPrimaryReasonsForBusinessCombination contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BusinessCombinationsAxis_entity00401731_AthomHoldingBVAndItsSubsidiariesOfBusinessCombinationsMemberOfDisclosureOfBusinessCombinationsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">스마트 공간 사업 역량 확보 및 강화</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfPrimaryReasonsForBusinessCombination>
  <ifrs-full:PercentageOfVotingEquityInterestsAcquired contextRef="PFY2024eFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BusinessCombinationsAxis_entity00401731_AthomHoldingBVAndItsSubsidiariesOfBusinessCombinationsMemberOfDisclosureOfBusinessCombinationsTableOfMember" unitRef="PURE" decimals="INF">0.800</ifrs-full:PercentageOfVotingEquityInterestsAcquired>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfArrangementForContingentConsiderationArrangementsAndIndemnificationAssets contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BusinessCombinationsAxis_entity00401731_OsoGroupAsAndItsSubsidiariesOfBusinessCombinationsMemberOfDisclosureOfBusinessCombinationsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 OSO Group AS 및 그 종속기업의 이전 소유주들에게 2025년도 OSO Group AS 및 그 종속기업의 EBITDA을 기준으로 일정 수준을 초과할 경우 추가적인 대가를 지급해야 하는 조건부 대가 약정을 포함했습니다. 약정 금액은 최대 49,133백만원으로 현금으로 지급될 예정이며, 취득일의 공정가치로 인식했습니다. 공정가치 변동은 이후 당기손익으로 인식될 예정입니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfArrangementForContingentConsiderationArrangementsAndIndemnificationAssets>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfPrimaryReasonsForBusinessCombination contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BusinessCombinationsAxis_entity00401731_BearRoboticsIncAndItsSubsidiariesOfBusinessCombinationsMemberOfDisclosureOfBusinessCombinationsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">가정ㆍ산업용 로봇 사업 강화</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfPrimaryReasonsForBusinessCombination>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfPrimaryReasonsForBusinessCombination contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BusinessCombinationsAxis_entity00401731_OsoGroupAsAndItsSubsidiariesOfBusinessCombinationsMemberOfDisclosureOfBusinessCombinationsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">B2B(기업 간 거래) 사업의 핵심 동력인 냉난방공조(HVAC) 분야 포트폴리오 강화</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfPrimaryReasonsForBusinessCombination>
